{"seq":20,"slug":"strategic-management","title":"战略管理","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.37,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"战略管理-简介\">战略管理 简介</h1><p>战略管理是组织在复杂竞争环境中识别方向、分配资源、创造持续竞争优势的系统性方法。对于技术人员而言，理解战略管理不仅意味着能够在更高维度上思考技术决策的业务影响，更意味着能够从执行者成长为真正的技术领导者——一个能够将技术能力与商业价值有效对齐的人。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向希望提升战略视野的技术管理者和高级工程师。无论你是需要制定技术路线图的架构师、参与公司战略讨论的技术总监，还是希望理解商业逻辑以做出更好技术决策的资深开发者，这里都将为你提供从战略思维到战略执行的完整知识框架。</p>\n<p>全书共分四个章节，覆盖战略管理的核心领域：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>战略思维基础</strong>从战略思维的本质出发，讲解战略层级与体系、愿景使命与价值观的构建，以及工程师如何培养战略思维，帮助你建立从全局视角审视技术和业务的能力。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>战略分析工具</strong>系统介绍 SWOT、PEST、波特五力等经典分析框架，深入竞争战略与差异化、蓝海战略与价值创新，让你掌握分析外部环境和内部资源的方法论。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>战略制定与选择</strong>聚焦战略规划流程、商业模式设计、技术战略与业务对齐，以及战略决策方法，帮助你参与和主导从方向确定到方案选择的完整过程。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>战略执行与评估</strong>深入 OKR 与目标管理体系、战略执行框架、战略复盘与调整，以及组织协同与战略落地，确保战略不只停留在纸面上，而是能够转化为实际的组织行动。</p>\n<p>建议按章节顺序学习。第一章建立思维基础，第二章提供分析工具，第三章聚焦战略制定，第四章关注落地执行，形成从认知到行动的完整闭环。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"strategic-thinking-foundations","title":"战略思维基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategic-thinking-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-strategic-thinking","title":"什么是战略思维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategic-thinking-foundations/what-is-strategic-thinking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"strategic-levels","title":"战略层级与体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategic-thinking-foundations/strategic-levels"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vision-mission-values","title":"愿景使命与价值观","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategic-thinking-foundations/vision-mission-values"},{"seq":4,"slug":"strategic-mindset-for-engineers","title":"工程师的战略思维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategic-thinking-foundations/strategic-mindset-for-engineers"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"strategic-analysis-tools","title":"战略分析工具","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategic-analysis-tools","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"swot-and-pest","title":"SWOT 与 PEST 分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategic-analysis-tools/swot-and-pest"},{"seq":2,"slug":"porters-five-forces","title":"波特五力模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategic-analysis-tools/porters-five-forces"},{"seq":3,"slug":"competitive-strategy","title":"竞争战略与差异化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategic-analysis-tools/competitive-strategy"},{"seq":4,"slug":"blue-ocean-strategy","title":"蓝海战略与价值创新","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategic-analysis-tools/blue-ocean-strategy"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"strategy-formulation","title":"战略制定与选择","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategy-formulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"strategic-planning-process","title":"战略规划流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategy-formulation/strategic-planning-process"},{"seq":2,"slug":"business-model-design","title":"商业模式设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategy-formulation/business-model-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tech-strategy-alignment","title":"技术战略与业务对齐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategy-formulation/tech-strategy-alignment"},{"seq":4,"slug":"strategic-decision-making","title":"战略决策方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategy-formulation/strategic-decision-making"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"strategy-execution","title":"战略执行与评估","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategy-execution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"okr-and-goal-systems","title":"OKR 与目标管理体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategy-execution/okr-and-goal-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"strategy-execution-framework","title":"战略执行框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategy-execution/strategy-execution-framework"},{"seq":3,"slug":"strategy-review-and-pivot","title":"战略复盘与调整","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategy-execution/strategy-review-and-pivot"},{"seq":4,"slug":"organizational-alignment","title":"组织协同与战略落地","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/strategic-management/strategy-execution/organizational-alignment"}]}]}